    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math fascinating, especially its patterns and logic. Growing up, my parents’ backgrounds in higher education sparked my early interest. Though I didn’t pursue advanced studies, I enjoy applying math concepts in everyday life, like calculating running routes or birdwatching statistics. It’s a creative, calming outlet.",
