    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I’ve used AI tools like Khan Academy and Wolfram Alpha for quick checks on math problems. It’s been helpful for verifying answers, but I avoid over-reliance. I prefer solving problems manually first to build intuition, then using AI for confirmation.",
