    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting to individual paces and styles. They can generate practice problems tailored to a student’s level, explain concepts in simple terms, and provide instant feedback. This helps students build confidence without overwhelming them with complex jargon."
